  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/ZGX4Hdq/img2-9.png\" alt=\"\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/0KsMXdx/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T104354-562-8-1.png\" width=\"170\" height=\"85\"></a>&nbsp;<img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/1rn1yR8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T104354-562-8-2.png\" width=\"170\" height=\"85\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCQ7fBfEwGsgTmKszznfehyA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/4ZWx3dC/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T104354-562-8-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"170\" height=\"85\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Мод, который превращает мирных и нейтральных мобов в смертоносные боевые машины!</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yRgPKjK/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-1.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWRPGMx/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-3.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Пожалуйста, публикуйте демонстрационные видео в виде встроенных ссылок в комментариях.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">не перепубликуйте мой мод на другом сайте без моего разрешения.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">Смело добавляйте его в свои модпаки.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">сообщайте о проблемах во вкладке «Issues» выше.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yRgPKjK/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-1.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/WWRPGMx/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-3.png\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/M8Ftjyz/img2-copy-4.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/yRgPKjK/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-1.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Piskel-2021-02-15-T120318-960-2.png\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/9tTMzH8/New-Pis